; orchard_windy_gap.room - O Vao do Vento (design 04 section 3.6); entered by a double jump from the mill town's dovecote ledge onto the east ledge (cols 36-38).
; Outono Espacial 2 (design 02 section 8): a 20-cell chasm with a westward current. Best-timed double jump: 15.8 cells, with the grey current
; 17.6; the gale played on the ledge into the current clears it (playtest 2026-10-10: 22 cells with a late press). Logico 2: Soltar drops the
; cocoon (col 6) on the shelf, an eastward gale from the shelf's west end or the floor blows it onto the plate at col 10, eight cells from
; the gate (col 2); behind it, the alcove (col 1) opens west at rows 6-8 under the shelf into orchard_ridge, the puzzle's reward (WORLD-35).
; From the ridge the gate stays shut once the cocoon goes back to its rope; the ridge's drop and the crag lead down.

